.MONDAY NIGHT...Mostly clear with slight chance of thunderstorms

in the evening, then partly cloudy after midnight. Lows in the

lower 60s. Chance of precipitation 20 percent. 

.TUESDAY...Decreasing clouds. Highs in the lower 90s. 

.TUESDAY NIGHT...Partly cloudy. Lows in the mid 60s. 

.WEDNESDAY...Decreasing clouds. Highs in the lower 90s. 



$$



