Flagstaff Aviation Discussion

Issued at 2304 UTC Wednesday, July 30, 2025



.AVIATION...Thursday 31/00Z through Friday 01/00Z...Mainly VFR 

conditions, outside of occasional MVFR conditions near and north of 

a KGCN-KPGA line in HZ/FU. ISO -SHRA/-TSRA possible before 03Z and 

again after 20Z, mainly east of KPAN-KINW-KRQE line. Gusty, erratic 

winds possible in and around TS. Daytime winds SW 10-20 kts with 

gusts 20-25 kts, becoming VRB ~5 kts overnight.

OUTLOOK...Friday 01/00Z through Sunday 03/00Z...Mainly VFR 

conditions, outside of occasional MVFR conditions near and north of 

a KGCN-KPGA line in HZ/FU. ISO -SHRA/-TSRA possible each afternoon, 

mainly over the higher terrain across eastern AZ. Gusty, erratic 

winds possible in and around TS. Daytime winds SW 8-14 kts with 

gusts to near 20 kts, becoming VRB ~5 kts overnight.





